e BTR test Micro-Anat - 2025-06-07","number":50,"stemHtml":"What is the embryological origin of the cells involved in this condition?<br/><img src=\"images/image_449_3_1.jpg\"/>","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Neural ectoderm"},{"label":"B","text":"Mesoderm"},{"label":"C","text":"Surface ectoderm"},{"label":"D","text":"Neural crest"}],"answer":"D","answerText":"Neural crest","solutionHtml":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\"><strong>Ans. D) Neural crest</strong></span></p><br/><br/>","tags":""}]}
